[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/316070253","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/3079#issuecomment-316070253","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/3079","id":316070253,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMxNjA3MDI1Mw==","user":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-07-18T13:52:09Z","updated_at":"2017-07-18T13:52:48Z","body":"I'm really struggling to understand this issue. Primarily due to the lack of a bug report, as is explicitly requested in the issue template. If you take a bug report shortly after playing your test stream using the demo app, it'll include detailed debugging information showing us what actually happened during the playback, including the track selections and adaptations that took place. Please play the sample in the demo app and capture a bug report.\r\n\r\nRegarding this:\r\n\r\n> Using group.getFormat(0) may return either the lowest or the highest available bitrate/resolution depending on how the manifest was written. This effectively means that exoplayer MAY start loading segment starting with the highest or the lowest quality chunk before actual adaptation logic kicks in.\r\n\r\nIt doesn't (or shouldn't) matter, since we'll discard and re-buffer a different format if the track selector indicates that a different stream should be selected after preparation completes. None of the media from the first format will be fed to the device decoders if this occurs.\r\n\r\n> Devices like Samsung S4 mini will just crash right away when trying to decode segments with very high resolutions.\r\n\r\nOur track selection logic does automatically avoid selecting streams that the device indicates it cannot support. So in general it shouldn't be necessary for you to do this kind of thing. It is possible that certain devices are over-reporting their own capabilities, however.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/316070253/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":1168377841,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDExNjgzNzc4NDE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/1168377841","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2017-07-18T13:52:14Z","label":{"name":"need more info","color":"5319e7"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/316075567","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/3079#issuecomment-316075567","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/3079","id":316075567,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMxNjA3NTU2Nw==","user":{"login":"davibe","id":123929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMzkyOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibe","html_url":"https://github.com/davibe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-07-18T14:09:53Z","updated_at":"2017-07-18T14:09:53Z","body":"I know a proper bug report would be better but I am not able to provide a publicly available example manifest at the moment.\r\n\r\nDespite what you said I can guarantee that with a manifest file as the one described above (sorted from the highest to the lowest quality) the first segments downloaded are the ones with very high resolution and they are used to initialize the decoder resulting in a failure.\r\nThis is true using the official exoplayer demo just feeding it the url of that manifest.\r\n\r\nI have asked my company if they can provide a public example and if so I will update this. In the mean time this is how I fixed it: https://github.com/davibe/ExoPlayer/commit/39e2980666b15f465133e4aee1bf84a3659dd26a\r\nBasically with this commit It always starts with the lowest quality fragment because it looks up the last one in the set of formats sorted by quality desc.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/316075567/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"davibe","id":123929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMzkyOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibe","html_url":"https://github.com/davibe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibe/foll