":false},"created_at":"2017-07-19T13:34:47Z","updated_at":"2017-07-19T13:34:47Z","body":"- This should be fixed on the `dev-v2` branch now. Please verify. Not that you shouldn't need to do anything explicit in application code to restrict the formats being used to those that the device can play, since ExoPlayer's `DefaultTrackSelector` should be doing that for you already (unless you're overriding it).\r\n- It's worth reporting the issue with the ordering in the master playlist to whoever is producing the content. Putting the highest quality variant first is against the guidelines and likely to cause issues for other players. It's also inefficient, since it means clients will download a chunk that's significantly larger than necessary during initialization. This may increase the time required for initial buffering.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/316388939/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","si